-- title:
--   Level-M' good-reduction ring lies in O (q=3)
-- statement:
--   Fix a prime $q$ with $q=3$ and a positive integer $M'$ not divisible by $q$, and let $A$ be a valuation subring of $\overline{\mathbb Q}$ with $q$ a non-unit of $A$. Let $W$ be a finite set of places of $\mathrm{modularFunctionFieldC}\,(\mathrm{ResidueField}\,A)\,M'$ (the subfield of Laurent series over the residue field $k=\mathrm{ResidueField}\,A$ generated by the reductions of $j$ and of $j(q^{M'})$-type generator $\mathrm{jqNModC}$) whose members are exactly the supersingular places, i.e. the rational affine geometric places $w$ with $w.\mathrm{evalAt}(\mathrm{jGeomGen}\,k\,M')\in \mathrm{ssJSet}\,q\,k$. Assume $\mathrm{modularFunctionFieldBar}\,M'\le \mathrm{fieldBar}\,q\,M'$, where the former is the subfield of $\overline{\mathbb Q}$-Laurent series generated by the coefficientwise images of the full level-$M'$ function field, and the latter is the function field over $\overline{\mathbb Q}$ of $X_H$ of level $q^2M'$ with $H\le(\mathbb Z/q^2M')^\times$ the kernel of reduction to $(\mathbb Z/q)^\times$. Let $R_0$ be a constant reduction of $A$ from $\mathrm{modularFunctionFieldBar}\,M'$ to $\mathrm{modularFunctionFieldC}\,k\,M'$, pinned coefficientwise: every Laurent series $y$ over $A$ whose image in $\overline{\mathbb Q}$-Laurent series lies in $\mathrm{modularFunctionFieldBar}\,M'$ lies in $R_0.\mathrm{integers}$, with residue the coefficientwise reduction of $y$. Let $\zeta$ be a primitive $q$-th root of unity in $\overline{\mathbb Q}$ and let $O_{\mathrm{Ig}}$, indexed by the projective line over $\mathbb Z/q$, and $O_{\mathrm{SS}}$, indexed by $W$, be families of valuation subrings of $\mathrm{fieldBar}\,q\,M'$ subject to: $O_{\mathrm{Ig}}(\infty)$, at the point $[1:0]$, consists of the ratios $x/y$ of Laurent series with coefficients in $A$ whose denominator has nonzero reduction; each $O_{\mathrm{Ig}}(\ell)$ is the pullback of $O_{\mathrm{Ig}}(\infty)$ along $\mathrm{levelAutBar}\,q\,M'\,\zeta\,\gamma$ for some $\gamma\in\Gamma_0(M')$ carrying $[1:0]$ to $\ell$ under the reduction $\mathrm{redQ}$; $O_{\mathrm{Ig}}$ is injective; and for each $\zeta'$ and each $\gamma\in\Gamma_0(M')$ the pullbacks along $\mathrm{levelAutBar}\,q\,M'\,\zeta'\,\gamma$ permute the family $O_{\mathrm{Ig}}$. For $O_{\mathrm{SS}}$: each $O_{\mathrm{SS}}(s)$ meets $\overline{\mathbb Q}$ exactly in $A$; each $O_{\mathrm{SS}}(s)$ is invariant under all pullbacks $\mathrm{levelAutBar}\,q\,M'\,\zeta'\,\gamma$ with $\gamma\in\Gamma_0(M')$; each $O_{\mathrm{SS}}(s)$ contains an element $t$ such that $t-a$ is a unit of $O_{\mathrm{SS}}(s)$ for every $a\in A$; and, for $f\in R_0.\mathrm{integers}$ whose order is non-negative at every place of $\mathrm{modularFunctionFieldBar}\,M'$ over $\overline{\mathbb Q}$ where $j$ has non-negative order, if the residue $R_0.\mathrm{residue}\,f$ lies in the valuation subring of $s$ then the image of $f$ lies in $O_{\mathrm{SS}}(s)$, and for every $a\in A$ whose residue equals $s.\mathrm{evalAt}(R_0.\mathrm{residue}\,f)$ the difference of the image of $f$ and of $a$ lies in the maximal ideal of $O_{\mathrm{SS}}(s)$. Finally let $O$ be a valuation subring of $\mathrm{fieldBar}\,q\,M'$ meeting $\overline{\mathbb Q}$ exactly in $A$ and such that for every polynomial $P$ over $A$ whose reduction modulo the maximal ideal of $A$ is nonzero, both $P(j)$ and $P(j)^{-1}$ lie in $O$, where $j$ denotes the image in $\mathrm{fieldBar}\,q\,M'$ of the coefficientwise image of the $q$-expansion $\mathrm{jq}$. Then every $f\in R_0.\mathrm{integers}$ has its image in $\mathrm{fieldBar}\,q\,M'$ lying in $O$.
--
--   This is the comparison step on the Igusa leg of the semistable covering of the level-$q^2M'$ modular curve: any valuation ring of the full-level field whose intersection with $\overline{\mathbb Q}$ is $A$ and which is unramified over the generic point of the $j$-line contains the good-reduction ring of the level-$M'$ floor. It is the $q=3$ case, and is used in the identification of the Igusa components of the special fibre via [`ModularCurve.FullLevel.exists_forall_coe_mem_igusa_iff_of_valuationSubring_levelField_of_eq_three`](thm.html#ModularCurve.FullLevel.exists_forall_coe_mem_igusa_iff_of_valuationSubring_levelField_of_eq_three).
